@url=http://localhost:3000

### Listado de tareas
GET {{url}}/tareas

### Buscar tarea por ID
GET {{url}}/tareas/1
### Crear tarea
POST {{url}}/tareas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tarea" : "cocinar",
  "completa" : true
}

### pedientes
GET {{url}}/tareas?completa=false


### modificar
PUT {{url}}/tareas/1

### eliminar
DELETE {{url}}/tareas/1